WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.495
CoCN reaches an average rank of one point eight
three across six node datasets,

00:00:05.575 --> 00:00:07.118
the best of any method.

00:00:07.198 --> 00:00:10.717
On Squirrel it scores nearly seventy-three percent,

00:00:10.797 --> 00:00:14.316
over eleven points above the strongest prior model.

00:00:14.396 --> 00:00:16.927
On COLLAB it hits eighty-six percent.

00:00:17.007 --> 00:00:22.220
And it cuts permutation modeling from intractable n
factorial to n squared.
